From c35ecd61258ad47608294be0498ea4f9eec130a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Sandoz <17123735+skyclmbr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 13:02:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/23] feat(vr): add phase3 interaction and render parity
 fixes

Add controller grab interactions with filtering, improve VR shading with VSP normals and depth occlusion, and tighten draw-style handling so mirrored geometry and shaded visibility behave consistently in-headset.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

